{"id":"b9a512938bcc6dc04024b7bb897fda2d2021c9aa","axis":"silent","repo":"elastic/elasticsearch","sha":"b9a512938bcc6dc04024b7bb897fda2d2021c9aa","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"benchmarks/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/search/scheduling/QuerySchedulerBenchmark.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,223 @@","+/*","+ * Copyright Elasticsearch B.V. and/or licensed to Elasticsearch B.V. under one","+ * or more contributor license agreements. Licensed under the \"Elastic License","+ * 2.0\", the \"GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only\", and the \"Server Side","+ * Public License v 1\"; you may not use this file except in compliance with, at","+ * your election, the \"Elastic License 2.0\", the \"GNU Affero General Public","+ * License v3.0 only\", or the \"Server Side Public License, v 1\".","+ */","+","+package org.elasticsearch.search.scheduling;","+","+import org.elasticsearch.benchmark.internal.BenchmarkLogging;","+import org.elasticsearch.common.settings.ClusterSettings;","+import org.elasticsearch.common.settings.Settings;","+import org.elasticsearch.common.util.concurrent.AbstractRunnable;","+import org.elasticsearch.common.util.concurrent.EsExecutors;","+import org.elasticsearch.common.util.concurrent.ThreadContext;","+import org.elasticsearch.index.search.stats.SearchStatsSettings;","+import org.elasticsearch.index.search.stats.ShardSearchStats;","+import org.elasticsearch.tasks.TaskId;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Benchmark;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.BenchmarkMode;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Fork;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Level;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Measurement;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Mode;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.OutputTimeUnit;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Param;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Scope;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Setup;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.State;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.TearDown;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.Warmup;","+import org.openjdk.jmh.infra.Blackhole;","+","+import java.util.ArrayList;","+import java.util.List;","+import java.util.Set;","+import java.util.concurrent.CountDownLatch;","+import java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService;","+import java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;","+import java.util.function.BooleanSupplier;","+","+/**","+ * Compares submitting search tasks to a pool directly with submitting them through {@link QueryScheduler}, on a fixed pool","+ * built like {@code search}, with real {@link ShardSearchStats} accumulating the waiting. Each operation submits a batch","+ * of {@link #tasks} tasks from one thread: {@code submit} times the submissions only, {@code complete} times until every","+ * task completed and the scheduler no longer tracks it. Results are per batch. Run with {@code -prof gc} for the bytes","+ * allocated per batch.","+ */","+@Fork(1)","+@Warmup(iterations = 3, time = 1)","+@Measurement(iterations = 5, time = 1)","+@BenchmarkMode(Mode.AverageTime)","+@OutputTimeUnit(TimeUnit.NANOSECONDS)","+@State(Scope.Benchmark)","+@SuppressWarnings(\"unused\") // invoked by benchmarking framework","+public class QuerySchedulerBenchmark {","+","+    static {","+        BenchmarkLogging.configure();","+    }","+","+    private static final int MAX_SHARDS = 100;","+    private static final BooleanSupplier HAS_WORK = () -> true;","+","+    /** Tasks per batch. */","+    @Param({ \"64\", \"1024\" })","+    private int tasks;","+","+    /** {@code direct} submits to the pool, {@code scheduler} through {@link QueryScheduler}, as the engines do. */","+    @Param({ \"direct\", \"scheduler\" })","+    private String mode;","+","+    /**","+     * Threads of the pool: 64 runs many tasks at once, 4 queues most of them. 0 runs each task inline on the submitting","+     * thread, so the time is what the scheduler adds to the tasks, without handing them to another thread.","+     */","+    @Param({ \"0\", \"64\", \"4\" })","+    private int threads;","+","+    /** Work per task in {@link Blackhole#consumeCPU} tokens: 0 exposes the bookkeeping, 10000 is tens of microseconds. */","+    @Param({ \"0\", \"10000\" })","+    private long work;","+","+    /** Queries the tasks of a batch are spread over: 1 shares one query, 64 gives each query a share of the tasks. */","+    @Param({ \"1\", \"64\" })","+    private int queries;","+","+    /**","+     * Shards per executor. 1 opens an executor per task for one of {@link #MAX_SHARDS} shards, like a DSL shard phase, so","+     * executors of a query share shards when there are more tasks than shards. More opens one executor per query for all","+     * its tasks, like an ES|QL shard batch (10 shards by default, 100 at most).","+     */","+    @Param({ \"1\", \"10\", \"100\" })","+    private int shards;","+","+    private ExecutorService pool;","+    private QueryScheduler scheduler;","+    private ShardSearchStats[] stats;","+    private List<QueryScheduler.Shard> batchShards;","+    private TaskId[] queryIds;","+    private CountDownLatch done;","+","+    @Setup(Level.Trial)","+    public void setup() {","+        pool = threads == 0","+            ? EsExecutors.DIRECT_EXECUTOR_SERVICE","+            : EsExecutors.newFixed(","+                \"search\",","+                threads,","+                threads * 1000,","+                EsExecutors.daemonThreadFactory(\"benchmark\", \"search\"),","+                new ThreadContext(Settings.EMPTY),","+                EsExecutors.TaskTrackingConfig.builder()","+                    .trackOngoingTasks()","+                    .trackExecutionTime(EsExecutors.TaskTrackingConfig.DEFAULT_EXECUTION_TIME_EWMA_ALPHA_FOR_TEST)","+                    .build()","+            );","+        scheduler = new QueryScheduler(System::nanoTime);","+        SearchStatsSettings settings = new SearchStatsSettings(","+            new ClusterSettings(Settings.EMPTY, Set.of(SearchStatsSettings.RECENT_READ_LOAD_HALF_LIFE_SETTING))","+        );","+        stats = new ShardSearchStats[MAX_SHARDS];","+        for (int i = 0; i < stats.length; i++) {","+            stats[i] = new ShardSearchStats(settings);","+        }","+        batchShards = new ArrayList<>(shards);","+        for (int i = 0; i < shards; i++) {","+            batchShards.add(shard(stats[i]));","+        }","+        queryIds = new TaskId[queries];","+        for (int i = 0; i < queries; i++) {","+            queryIds[i] = new TaskId(\"coordinator\", i);","+        }","+    }","+","+    @TearDown(Level.Trial)","+    public void tearDown() throws InterruptedException {","+        if (threads > 0) {","+            pool.shutdown();","+            if (pool.awaitTermination(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS) == false) {","+                throw new IllegalStateException(\"pool did not terminate\");","+            }","+        }","+        if (scheduler.queries() != 0) {","+            throw new IllegalStateException(\"queries still tracked: \" + scheduler.queries());","+        }","+    }","+","+    /** Waits for the tasks of the last operation, outside the measured time. */","+    @TearDown(Level.Invocation)","+    public void awaitTasks() throws InterruptedException {","+        done.await();","+        awaitUntracked();","+    }","+","+    @Benchmark","+    public void submit() {","+        submitAll();","+    }","+","+    @Benchmark","+    public void complete() throws InterruptedException {","+        submitAll().await();","+        awaitUntracked();","+    }","+","+    /** The tasks count the latch down before the scheduler stops tracking them. */","+    private void awaitUntracked() {","+        while (scheduler.queries() != 0) {","+            Thread.onSpinWait();","+        }","+    }","+","+    private CountDownLatch submitAll() {","+        CountDownLatch latch = new CountDownLatch(tasks);","+        done = latch;","+        if (mode.equals(\"direct\")) {","+            for (int i = 0; i < tasks; i++) {","+                pool.execute(task(latch));","+            }","+        } else if (shards == 1) {","+            for (int i = 0; i < tasks; i++) {","+                ShardSearchStats shardStats = stats[i % stats.length];","+                scheduler.newExecutor(queryIds[i % queries], pool, List.of(shard(shardStats))).execute(task(latch));","+            }","+        } else {","+            QueryScheduler.QueryExecutor[] executors = new QueryScheduler.QueryExecutor[queries];","+            for (int q = 0; q < queries; q++) {","+                executors[q] = scheduler.newExecutor(queryIds[q], pool, batchShards);","+            }","+            for (int i = 0; i < tasks; i++) {","+                executors[i % queries].execute(task(latch));","+            }","+        }","+        return latch;","+    }","+","+    /** A shard as {@link QueryScheduler#executor} builds it from a searched shard. */","+    private static QueryScheduler.Shard shard(ShardSearchStats shardStats) {","+        return new QueryScheduler.Shard(shardStats, shardStats::accumulateSearchWaiting, HAS_WORK);","+    }","+","+    private AbstractRunnable task(CountDownLatch latch) {","+        return new AbstractRunnable() {","+            @Override","+            protected void doRun() {","+                Blackhole.consumeCPU(work);","+            }","+","+            @Override","+            public void onAfter() {","+                latch.countDown();","+            }","+","+            @Override","+            public void onFailure(Exception e) {","+                throw new AssertionError(e);","+            }","+        };","+    }","+}"],"additions":223,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/changelog/163119.yaml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+area: Search","+issues: []","+pr: 163119","+summary: Measure search waiting per query and shard","+type: enhancement"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"rest-api-spec/src/yamlRestTest/resources/rest-api-spec/test/indices.stats/81_search_waiting.yml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@","+---","+setup:","+  - requires:","+      cluster_features: [\"search.stats.recent_search_waiting\"]","+      reason: Search waiting stats were introduced in 9.7","+---","+\"Search waiting is tracked at shard level\":","+  - do:","+      indices.create:","+        index: index","+        body:","+          mappings:","+            properties:","+              name:","+                type: text","+","+  - do:","+      indices.stats:","+        index: \"index\"","+        level: shards","+        metric: [ search ]","+","+  - match: { _all.total.search.recent_search_waiting: 0.0 }","+  - match: { indices.index.total.search.recent_search_waiting: 0.0 }","+  - match: { indices.index.shards.0.0.search.recent_search_waiting: 0.0 }","+","+  - do:","+      index:","+        index: index","+        refresh: true","+        body: { \"name\": \"specialty coffee\" }","+","+  - do:","+      search:","+        index: index","+        body:","+          query:","+            match: { name: \"specialty coffee\" }","+","+  - do:","+      indices.stats:","+        index: \"index\"","+        level: shards","+        metric: [ search ]","+","+  - gte: { _all.total.search.recent_search_waiting: 0.0 }","+  - gte: { indices.index.total.search.recent_search_waiting: 0.0 }","+  - gte: { indices.index.shards.0.0.search.recent_search_waiting: 0.0 }"],"additions":48,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"server/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/search/SearchWaitingIT.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,89 @@","+/*","+ * Copyright Elasticsearch B.V. and/or licensed to Elasticsearch B.V. under one","+ * or more contributor license agreements. Licensed under the \"Elastic License","+ * 2.0\", the \"GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only\", and the \"Server Side","+ * Public License v 1\"; you may not use this file except in compliance with, at","+ * your election, the \"Elastic License 2.0\", the \"GNU Affero General Public","+ * License v3.0 only\", or the \"Server Side Public License, v 1\".","+ */","+","+package org.elasticsearch.search;","+","+import org.elasticsearch.action.ActionFuture;","+import org.elasticsearch.action.search.SearchResponse;","+import org.elasticsearch.common.settings.Settings;","+import org.elasticsearch.index.search.stats.SearchStats;","+import org.elasticsearch.test.ESIntegTestCase;","+import org.elasticsearch.threadpool.ThreadPool;","+","+import java.util.concurrent.CountDownLatch;","+import java.util.concurrent.Executor;","+","+import static org.elasticsearch.test.hamcrest.ElasticsearchAssertions.assertHitCount;","+import static org.elasticsearch.test.hamcrest.ElasticsearchAssertions.assertResponse;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.equalTo;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.greaterThan;","+","+/**","+ * A search waiting on a data node whose search threads are all busy is tracked as one query, however many of its shard","+ * tasks are queued, and reports its search waiting on the shards it searched.","+ */","+@ESIntegTestCase.ClusterScope(scope = ESIntegTestCase.Scope.TEST, numDataNodes = 0)","+public class SearchWaitingIT extends ESIntegTestCase {","+","+    private static final int SEARCH_THREADS = 2;","+","+    public void testBatchedQueryPhase() throws Exception {","+        assertWaitingIsTrackedPerQuery(true);","+    }","+","+    public void testShardQueryPhase() throws Exception {","+        assertWaitingIsTrackedPerQuery(false);","+    }","+","+    private void assertWaitingIsTrackedPerQuery(boolean batched) throws Exception {","+        String dataNode = internalCluster().startNode(Settings.builder().put(\"thread_pool.search.size\", SEARCH_THREADS).build());","+        String coordinator = internalCluster().startCoordinatingOnlyNode(","+            Settings.builder().put(SearchService.BATCHED_QUERY_PHASE.getKey(), batched).build()","+        );","+        int shards = between(SEARCH_THREADS + 1, 8);","+        createIndex(\"test\", indexSettings(shards, 0).build());","+        createIndex(\"other\", indexSettings(1, 0).build());","+        int docs = between(1, 20);","+        for (int i = 0; i < docs; i++) {","+            prepareIndex(\"test\").setSource(\"field\", i).get();","+        }","+        refresh(\"test\");","+","+        SearchService searchService = internalCluster().getInstance(SearchService.class, dataNode);","+        Executor searchPool = internalCluster().getInstance(ThreadPool.class, dataNode).executor(ThreadPool.Names.SEARCH);","+        CountDownLatch blocked = new CountDownLatch(SEARCH_THREADS);","+        CountDownLatch release = new CountDownLatch(1);","+        for (int i = 0; i < SEARCH_THREADS; i++) {","+            searchPool.execute(() -> {","+                blocked.countDown();","+                safeAwait(release);","+            });","+        }","+        safeAwait(blocked);","+","+        ActionFuture<SearchResponse> future = client(coordinator).prepareSearch(\"test\").setSize(docs).execute();","+        try {","+            // all shard tasks of the search are queued behind the blocked threads, as one query","+            assertBusy(() -> assertThat(searchService.queryScheduler().queries(), equalTo(1)));","+            // the waiting is charged when the tasks leave the queue","+            assertThat(searchWaiting(\"test\").getSearchWaitingRate(), equalTo(0.0));","+        } finally {","+            release.countDown();","+        }","+        assertResponse(future, response -> assertHitCount(response, docs));","+        assertBusy(() -> assertThat(searchService.queryScheduler().queries(), equalTo(0)));","+","+        assertThat(searchWaiting(\"test\").getSearchWaitingRate(), greaterThan(0.0));","+        assertThat(searchWaiting(\"other\").getSearchWaitingRate(), equalTo(0.0));","+    }","+","+    private static SearchStats.Stats searchWaiting(String index) {","+        return indicesAdmin().prepareStats(index).setSearch(true).get().getIndex(index).getTotal().getSearch().getTotal();","+    }","+}"],"additions":89,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"server/src/main/java/module-info.java","lines":["@@ -344,6 +344,7 @@","     exports org.elasticsearch.script.field;","     exports org.elasticsearch.script.field.vectors;","     exports org.elasticsearch.search;","+    exports org.elasticsearch.search.scheduling;","     exports org.elasticsearch.search.aggregations;","     exports org.elasticsearch.search.aggregations.bucket;","     exports org.elasticsearch.search.aggregations.bucket.composite;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/search/stats/SearchStats.java","lines":["@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ public class SearchStats implements Writeable, ToXContentFragment {","     public static class Stats implements Writeable, ToXContentFragment {"," ","         private static final TransportVersion SEARCH_LOAD_PER_INDEX_STATS = TransportVersion.fromName(\"search_load_per_index_stats\");","+        private static final TransportVersion SEARCH_QUERY_WAITING = TransportVersion.fromName(\"search_query_waiting\");"," ","         private long queryCount;","         private long queryTimeInMillis;","@@ -55,6 +56,9 @@ public static class Stats implements Writeable, ToXContentFragment {","         // values by assigning them greater significance than older values.","         private double recentSearchLoad;"," ","+        // Like recentSearchLoad, for the time queries waited with work for the shard and nothing running on the node.","+        private double recentSearchWaiting;","+","         private Stats() {","             // for internal use, initializes all counts to 0","         }","@@ -75,6 +79,44 @@ public Stats(","             long suggestTimeInMillis,","             long suggestCurrent,","             double recentSearchLoad","+        ) {","+            this(","+                queryCount,","+                queryTimeInMillis,","+                queryCurrent,","+                queryFailure,","+                fetchCount,","+                fetchTimeInMillis,","+                fetchCurrent,","+                fetchFailure,","+                scrollCount,","+                scrollTimeInMillis,","+                scrollCurrent,","+                suggestCount,","+                suggestTimeInMillis,","+                suggestCurrent,","+                recentSearchLoad,","+                0","+            );","+        }","+","+        public Stats(","+            long queryCount,","+            long queryTimeInMillis,","+            long queryCurrent,","+            long queryFailure,","+            long fetchCount,","+            long fetchTimeInMillis,","+            long fetchCurrent,","+            long fetchFailure,","+            long scrollCount,","+            long scrollTimeInMillis,","+            long scrollCurrent,","+            long suggestCount,","+            long suggestTimeInMillis,","+            long suggestCurrent,","+            double recentSearchLoad,","+            double recentSearchWaiting","         ) {","             this.queryCount = queryCount;","             this.queryTimeInMillis = queryTimeInMillis;","@@ -95,7 +137,7 @@ public Stats(","             this.suggestCurrent = suggestCurrent;"," ","             this.recentSearchLoad = recentSearchLoad;","-","+            this.recentSearchWaiting = recentSearchWaiting;","         }"," ","         private Stats(StreamInput in) throws IOException {","@@ -121,6 +163,9 @@ private Stats(StreamInput in) throws IOException {","             if (in.getTransportVersion().supports(SEARCH_LOAD_PER_INDEX_STATS)) {","                 recentSearchLoad = in.readDouble();","             }","+            if (in.getTransportVersion().supports(SEARCH_QUERY_WAITING)) {","+                recentSearchWaiting = in.readDouble();","+            }","         }"," ","         @Override","@@ -147,6 +192,9 @@ public void writeTo(StreamOutput out) throws IOException {","             if (out.getTransportVersion().supports(SEARCH_LOAD_PER_INDEX_STATS)) {","                 out.writeDouble(recentSearchLoad);","             }","+            if (out.getTransportVersion().supports(SEARCH_QUERY_WAITING)) {","+                out.writeDouble(recentSearchWaiting);","+            }","         }"," ","         public void add(Stats stats) {","@@ -169,6 +217,7 @@ public void add(Stats stats) {","             suggestCurrent += stats.suggestCurrent;"," ","             recentSearchLoad += stats.recentSearchLoad;","+            recentSearchWaiting += stats.recentSearchWaiting;","         }"," ","         public void addForClosingShard(Stats stats) {","@@ -189,6 +238,7 @@ public void addForClosingShard(Stats stats) {","             suggestTimeInMillis += stats.suggestTimeInMillis;"," ","             recentSearchLoad += stats.recentSearchLoad;","+            recentSearchWaiting += stats.recentSearchWaiting;","         }"," ","         public long getQueryCount() {","@@ -267,6 +317,10 @@ public double getSearchLoadRate() {","             return recentSearchLoad;","         }"," ","+        public double getSearchWaitingRate() {","+            return recentSearchWaiting;","+        }","+","         public static Stats readStats(StreamInput in) throws IOException {","             return new Stats(in);","         }","@@ -292,6 +346,7 @@ public XContentBuilder toXContent(XContentBuilder builder, Params params) throws","             builder.field(Fields.SUGGEST_CURRENT, suggestCurrent);"," ","             builder.field(Fields.RECENT_SEARCH_LOAD, recentSearchLoad);","+            builder.field(Fields.RECENT_SEARCH_WAITING, recentSearchWaiting);"," ","             return builder;","         }","@@ -315,7 +370,8 @@ public boolean equals(Object o) {","                 && suggestCount == that.suggestCount","                 && suggestTimeInMillis == that.suggestTimeInMillis","                 && suggestCurrent == that.suggestCurrent","-                && recentSearchLoad == that.recentSearchLoad;","+                && recentSearchLoad == that.recentSearchLoad","+                && recentSearchWaiting == that.recentSearchWaiting;","         }"," ","         @Override","@@ -335,7 +391,8 @@ public int hashCode() {","                 suggestCount,","                 suggestTimeInMillis,","                 suggestCurrent,","-                recentSearchLoad","+                recentSearchLoad,","+                recentSearchWaiting","             );","         }","     }","@@ -454,6 +511,7 @@ static final class Fields {","         static final String SUGGEST_TIME_IN_MILLIS = \"suggest_time_in_millis\";","         static final String SUGGEST_CURRENT = \"suggest_current\";","         static final String RECENT_SEARCH_LOAD = \"recent_search_load\";","+        static final String RECENT_SEARCH_WAITING = \"recent_search_waiting\";","     }"," ","     @Override"],"additions":61,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/search/stats/ShardSearchStats.java","lines":["@@ -240,6 +240,16 @@ public void accumulateSearchLoad(long tookInNanos, long nowInNanos) {","         totalStats.addSearchLoad(tookInNanos, nowInNanos);","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Accumulates the recent search waiting for this shard: the time a query waited with work for it queued on the node.","+     *","+     * @param waitedInNanos the time waited, in nanoseconds","+     * @param nowInNanos    the time the waiting was measured up to, from {@link System#nanoTime()}","+     */","+    public void accumulateSearchWaiting(long waitedInNanos, long nowInNanos) {","+        totalStats.recentSearchWaiting.addIncrement(waitedInNanos, nowInNanos);","+    }","+","     static final class StatsHolder {","         final MeanMetric queryMetric = new MeanMetric();","         final MeanMetric fetchMetric = new MeanMetric();","@@ -261,11 +271,14 @@ static final class StatsHolder {","         final CounterMetric fetchFailure = new CounterMetric();"," ","         final ExponentiallyWeightedMovingRate recentSearchL